WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.740
Welcome to Module 14 of the
Non-Person Identity learning path:

2
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:08.288
workload identity across
AWS GovCloud and O C I.

3
00:00:08.288 --> 00:00:12.878
It teaches the implementation guide's
steps for the program's other two clouds,

4
00:00:12.878 --> 00:00:15.376
with Chapter 13 of the developer workbook.

5
00:00:15.376 --> 00:00:18.787
The program's AWS estate
is in AWS GovCloud,

6
00:00:18.787 --> 00:00:24.637
and its Oracle Cloud tenancy is in
Oracle's US Government Cloud, realm O C 2.

7
00:00:24.637 --> 00:00:29.962
In November 2026 the program added both
clouds' workload identities to this track.

8
00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:32.860
Take this module after Modules 1 and 4.
